-- Build step 5 (the records-kit modules): the super admin configures every
--> statement-breakpoint
-- new module (record types, fields, statuses, switches) and can see and
--> statement-breakpoint
-- export its records. Daily work stays with the hotel's own roles, which
--> statement-breakpoint
-- already hold each module's wildcard permissions from the pre-made roles.
